{"seq":4,"slug":"subscription-pricing-billing","title":"订阅、定价与计费","stage":"DONE","category":"indie-app-shipping","categoryLabel":"独立开发与上架","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/subscription-pricing-billing","rating":{"composite":3.6,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 订阅、定价与计费 简介\n\n定价直接决定独立产品能否赚到可持续的钱，是发布之外最该认真对待的商业决策。本 hub 面向要给 app 设计变现的独立开发者，从定价模型（买断 vs 订阅、免费增值 vs 免费试用、用量与分层）讲起，覆盖付费墙与转化（付费墙设计、免费试用机制、方案结构与锚定）、计费基础设施（Stripe 与 Web 计费、IAP 与 RevenueCat、平台抽成与支付规则），以及定价的演进（价格实验、涨价、流失感知定价）。贯穿全篇的实操主线是：让定价模型匹配产品创造价值的方式、价值定价而非成本定价且宁高勿低、把计费这件高风险的事交给成熟服务、并把定价当作持续优化的变量——降低流失（尤其用催缴挽回非自愿流失、主推年付）与适时涨价，是订阅生意可持续的关键。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pricing-models","title":"Pricing Models","docCount":3,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/subscription-pricing-billing/pricing-models","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"one-time-vs-subscription","title":"一次性买断与订阅","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/subscription-pricing-billing/pricing-models/one-time-vs-subscription","wordCount":1726,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"freemium-and-free-trial","title":"免费增值与免费试用","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/subscription-pricing-billing/pricing-models/freemium-and-free-trial","wordCount":1597,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"usage-and-tiered-pricing","title":"用量计费与分层定价","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/subscription-pricing-billing/pricing-models/usage-and-tiered-pricing","wordCount":1769,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲定价模型：买断（收入不累积）vs 订阅（经常性收入、复利）的取舍与如何匹配产品的价值方式、免费增值与免费试用两种「先体验后付费」策略的机制与成本权衡，以及分层与用量计费如何让收费与价值对齐并随用户成长增收（AI 产品尤其适合用量计费对齐成本）。\n"},{"seq":2,"slug":"paywall-and-conversion","title":"Paywall And Conversion","docCount":3,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/subscription-pricing-billing/paywall-and-conversion","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"paywall-design","title":"付费墙设计","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/subscription-pricing-billing/paywall-and-conversion/paywall-design","wordCount":1652,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"free-trial-mechanics","title":"免费试用的机制","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/subscription-pricing-billing/paywall-and-conversion/free-trial-mechanics","wordCount":1677,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"plan-structure-and-anchoring","title":"方案结构与锚定","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/subscription-pricing-billing/paywall-and-conversion/plan-structure-and-anchoring","wordCount":1766,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲付费墙与转化：呈现价值而非功能、降低支付摩擦、在用户痛点时刻呈现的付费墙设计，让用户到期前体验到「不想失去」价值的免费试用机制（时长/绑卡/引导/到期转化），以及用锚定与三档结构引导选择的方案设计——引导而非操纵。\n"},{"seq":3,"slug":"billing-infrastructure","title":"Billing Infrastructure","docCount":3,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/subscription-pricing-billing/billing-infrastructure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"stripe-and-web-billing","title":"Stripe 与 Web 计费","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/subscription-pricing-billing/billing-infrastructure/stripe-and-web-billing","wordCount":1808,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"iap-and-revenuecat","title":"应用内购与 RevenueCat","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/subscription-pricing-billing/billing-infrastructure/iap-and-revenuecat","wordCount":1651,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"platform-cut-and-payment-rules","title":"平台抽成与支付规则","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/subscription-pricing-billing/billing-infrastructure/platform-cut-and-payment-rules","wordCount":1826,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲计费基础设施：Web 端用 Stripe（封装支付复杂性、可靠处理 webhook、避开平台抽成）、移动端用 IAP 并以 RevenueCat 统一跨平台订阅、以及 Apple/Google 15–30% 抽成与「app 内不能引导外部支付」的支付规则现实与合规应对。别自己造支付轮子。\n"},{"seq":4,"slug":"pricing-over-time","title":"Pricing Over Time","docCount":3,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/subscription-pricing-billing/pricing-over-time","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"price-experiments","title":"价格实验","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/subscription-pricing-billing/pricing-over-time/price-experiments","wordCount":1598,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"raising-prices","title":"涨价","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/subscription-pricing-billing/pricing-over-time/raising-prices","wordCount":1848,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"churn-aware-pricing","title":"流失感知定价","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/subscription-pricing-billing/pricing-over-time/churn-aware-pricing","wordCount":1744,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲定价的演进：把价格当作最有杠杆却最少优化的变量去持续做价格实验（盯收入与用户质量而非只看转化）、用「老用户锁价+新用户提价」稳妥而透明地涨价，以及用催缴挽回非自愿流失、主推年付、诚实挽留来做流失感知定价——留存与获客同等重要。\n"}]}